{"seq":3,"slug":"fermentation-tech","title":"高二生物 — 发酵技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-2/biology/biotechnology/fermentation-tech","wordCount":2319,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"高二生物-发酵技术\">高二生物 — 发酵技术</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>发酵技术是利用微生物的代谢活动来生产特定产物的生物技术。从远古时期的酿酒和发面，到现代工业化生产抗生素、氨基酸和生物燃料，发酵技术经历了从经验到科学的跨越。理解发酵的微生物学原理和工艺控制要点，是连接生物学基础知识与实际应用的重要桥梁。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>发酵</td>\n<td>利用微生物在有氧或无氧条件下的代谢活动生产特定产物的过程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>培养基</td>\n<td>人工配制的供微生物生长繁殖的营养物质</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>灭菌</td>\n<td>彻底杀灭所有微生物（包括芽孢）的方法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消毒</td>\n<td>杀死大部分病原微生物但不一定杀灭芽孢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>纯培养</td>\n<td>仅含单一种类微生物的培养</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-微生物的培养基础\">一、微生物的培养基础</h3><p><strong>培养基的类型与成分：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>培养基类型</th>\n<th>物理状态</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>液体培养基</td>\n<td>无凝固剂</td>\n<td>工业发酵、扩大培养</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>固体培养基</td>\n<td>加琼脂凝固</td>\n<td>分离计数、保存菌种</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>半固体培养基</td>\n<td>少量琼脂</td>\n<td>观察运动性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>培养基的基本营养成分：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成分</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>碳源</td>\n<td>提供碳骨架和能量</td>\n<td>葡萄糖、淀粉、蔗糖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>氮源</td>\n<td>合成蛋白质和核酸</td>\n<td>铵盐、尿素、蛋白胨</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>矿质元素</td>\n<td>酶的辅基、维持渗透压</td>\n<td>磷酸盐、硫酸镁、氯化钠</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>水</td>\n<td>溶剂，参与代谢反应</td>\n<td>蒸馏水</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特殊营养</td>\n<td>特定微生物需要的生长因子</td>\n<td>维生素、氨基酸</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>选择培养基</strong>：通过添加或去除某种成分，使只有特定微生物能够生长。例如：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>加入青霉素的培养基只允许耐青霉素的细菌生长</li>\n<li>以尿素为唯一氮源的培养基只允许能分解尿素的细菌生长</li>\n<li>不含氮源的培养基可以筛选出固氮微生物</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"二-无菌技术\">二、无菌技术</h3><p>无菌操作是发酵技术成功的前提。如果杂菌污染了培养物，不仅会消耗营养、产生有害代谢物，还可能完全抑制目标微生物的生长。</p>\n<p><strong>灭菌与消毒的区别：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>目的</th>\n<th>手段</th>\n<th>对象</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>灭菌</td>\n<td>杀灭所有微生物（含芽孢）</td>\n<td>高压蒸汽灭菌（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>121</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">121°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">121°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>30</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>min</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15 \\sim 30\\,\\text{min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">min</span></span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td>培养基、器具</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消毒</td>\n<td>杀死大部分病原菌</td>\n<td>酒精擦拭、煮沸、紫外线照射</td>\n<td>皮肤、操作台面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过滤除菌</td>\n<td>去除液体中的微生物</td>\n<td>微孔滤膜（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.22</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>μ</mi><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.22\\,\\mu\\text{m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.22</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m</span></span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td>不耐高温的液体</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>操作要点：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>接种环使用前后都要在酒精灯火焰上灼烧灭菌</li>\n<li>培养皿需倒扣放置（防止冷凝水滴落到培养基表面污染菌落）</li>\n<li>操作时在酒精灯旁进行（火焰周围形成无菌区）</li>\n<li>实验者双手需酒精消毒</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"三-微生物的纯培养与计数\">三、微生物的纯培养与计数</h3><p><strong>平板划线法</strong>——用于分离单个菌落：</p>\n<p>在固体培养基表面用接种环连续划线，使细菌逐渐稀释。经培养后，划线末端区域的单个细菌会形成独立的菌落，每个菌落来源于一个细菌细胞。</p>\n<p><strong>稀释涂布平板法</strong>——用于分离和计数：</p>\n<p>将菌液梯度稀释后，取一定体积均匀涂布在固体培养基表面。经培养后计数菌落数，计算原始菌液的菌浓度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>菌浓度</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>平均菌落数</mtext><mrow><mtext>涂布体积</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>稀释倍数</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{菌浓度} = \\frac{\\text{平均菌落数}}{\\text{涂布体积} \\times \\text{稀释倍数}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">菌浓度</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">涂布体积</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">稀释倍数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">平均菌落数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>例如：将菌液稀释 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 倍后取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>mL</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.1\\,\\text{mL}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mL</span></span></span></span></span></span> 涂布，长出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>150</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">150</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">150</span></span></span></span></span> 个菌落。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>菌浓度</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>150</mn><mrow><mn>0.1</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1.5</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mtext>个/mL</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{菌浓度} = \\frac{150}{0.1 \\times 10^{-5}} = 1.5 \\times 10^8\\,\\text{个/mL}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">菌浓度</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0908em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">150</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">个</span><span class=\"mord\">/mL</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>注意：该方法计数结果通常<strong>偏低</strong>（两个紧邻的细菌可能形成一个菌落）。因此结果常称为&quot;菌落形成单位&quot;（CFU），而非精确细菌数。</p>\n<h3 id=\"四-传统发酵技术\">四、传统发酵技术</h3><p><strong>（1）果酒发酵（酵母菌的无氧呼吸）</strong></p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>C</mtext><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>12</mn></msub><msub><mtext>O</mtext><mn>6</mn></msub><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>酵母菌</mtext></mpadded></mover><mn>2</mn><msub><mtext>C</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>5</mn></msub><mtext>OH</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{C}_6\\text{H}_{12}\\text{O}_6 \\xrightarrow{\\text{酵母菌}} 2\\text{C}_2\\text{H}_5\\text{OH} + 2\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2503em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">12</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span c