cal-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>要素</th>\n<th>条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>温度</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>35</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30 \\sim 35°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">35°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>氧气</td>\n<td><strong>需要充足的氧气</strong>（好氧发酵）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原料</td>\n<td>可直接用果酒作为原料</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>（3）泡菜发酵（乳酸菌的无氧呼吸）</strong></p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>C</mtext><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>12</mn></msub><msub><mtext>O</mtext><mn>6</mn></msub><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>乳酸菌</mtext></mpadded></mover><mn>2</mn><msub><mtext>C</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mtext>O</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>乳酸</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{C}_6\\text{H}_{12}\\text{O}_6 \\xrightarrow{\\text{乳酸菌}} 2\\text{C}_3\\text{H}_6\\text{O}_3(\\text{乳酸})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2503em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">12</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">乳酸菌</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">乳酸</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>制作泡菜时，坛口要用水密封隔绝空气，为乳酸菌创造无氧环境。泡菜中含有亚硝酸盐（由杂菌产生），但随着乳酸积累和 pH 降低，亚硝酸盐含量在发酵后期会下降到安全水平。</p>\n<h3 id=\"五-现代工业发酵\">五、现代工业发酵</h3><p>工业发酵将微生物培养扩大到工厂规模，需要精确控制多个参数：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>控制目的</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>温度</td>\n<td>保持在微生物最适温度范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pH</td>\n<td>缓冲液或自动加酸/碱调节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>溶氧</td>\n<td>通气搅拌控制（好氧发酵）或密封（厌氧发酵）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>营养物补充</td>\n<td>流加培养（防止底物抑制）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无菌控制</td>\n<td>全系统灭菌，防止杂菌污染</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>工业发酵的产物类型：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>产物</th>\n<th>微生物</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>初级代谢产物</td>\n<td>氨基酸、维生素、乙醇</td>\n<td>谷氨酸棒杆菌（味精）、酵母菌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>次级代谢产物</td>\n<td>抗生素</td>\n<td>青霉菌（青霉素）、链霉菌（链霉素）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>微生物菌体</td>\n<td>单细胞蛋白</td>\n<td>螺旋藻、酵母菌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>酶制剂</td>\n<td>蛋白酶、淀粉酶、纤维素酶</td>\n<td>枯草芽孢杆菌、黑曲霉</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"六-发酵工程与基因工程的结合\">六、发酵工程与基因工程的结合</h3><p>现代发酵工程常与基因工程技术结合：先通过基因工程改造微生物（如导入人胰岛素基因的大肠杆菌），再通过发酵工程大规模培养这些工程菌，获得目标蛋白产品。</p>\n<p>生物工程的技术链：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[基因工程] --&gt;|构建工程菌| B[发酵工程]&#10;    B --&gt;|大规模培养| C[分离纯化]&#10;    C --&gt; D[目标产品]&#10;    E[细胞工程] --&gt;|优化宿主细胞| B\">graph LR\n    A[基因工程] --&gt;|构建工程菌| B[发酵工程]\n    B --&gt;|大规模培养| C[分离纯化]\n    C --&gt; D[目标产品]\n    E[细胞工程] --&gt;|优化宿主细胞| B</pre><h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>为什么制作果酒时先通气后密封？通气和密封分别有什么目的？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>制作泡菜时为什么要用水密封坛口？如果密封不严会导致什么后果？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>平板划线法和稀释涂布平板法的目的分别是什么？各有什么优缺点？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>用稀释涂布平板法计数时，某同学取稀释 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 倍的菌液 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>mL</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.1\\,\\text{mL}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mL</span></span></span></span></span></span> 涂布，三个平板上分别长出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>42</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">42</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">42</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>38</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">38</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">38</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span></span></span></span></span> 个菌落。估算原菌液的菌浓度。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>用含青霉素的培养基筛选耐药菌株属于什么培养基？其原理是什么？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p>抗生素的发现是发酵技术最伟大的贡献之一。1928 年弗莱明偶然发现青霉菌能抑制葡萄球菌生长，但直到 1940 年代弗洛里和钱恩解决了青霉素的大规模发酵生产问题后，这种&quot;神药&quot;才真正拯救了千百万人的生命。二战中青霉素的工业化生产是生物技术史上的里程碑事件。</p>\n<p>合成生物学正在将发酵技术推向新高度。科学家通过重新设计微生物的代谢网络，使酵母菌能合成原本只存在于植物中的化合物。例如，改造后的酵母菌可以发酵生产青蒿素（疟疾治疗药物）的前体物质，极大降低了青蒿素的生产成本。2013 年，半合成青蒿素的工业化生产正式启动，这是合成生物学从实验室走向产业化的标志性成就。</p>\n<p>生物燃料也是发酵技术的前沿应用方向。利用纤维素酶将农业废弃物（秸秆、玉米芯）降解为可发酵的糖类，再由酵母菌发酵生产乙醇，有望部分替代化石燃料，实现碳中和目标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>发酵技术利用微生物代谢活动生产有用产物，分为传统发酵和工业发酵</li>\n<li>培养基按物理状态分为液体、固体、半固体，按功能分为通用和选择培养基</li>\n<li>灭菌（杀灭一切微生物）和消毒（杀死大部分病原菌）是两个不同概念</li>\n<li>果酒发酵（厌氧）、果醋发酵（有氧）和泡菜发酵（厌氧）是三种经典传统发酵</li>\n<li>稀释涂布平板法可用于菌落计数，结果以 CFU 表示，通常偏低</li>\n<li>现代发酵工程与基因工程结合，可大规模生产药用蛋白等高价值产品</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高二生物 — 发酵技术","id":"高二生物-发酵技术"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、微生物的培养基础","id":"一-微生物的培养基础"},{"level":3,"text":"二、无菌技术","id":"二-无菌技术"},{"level":3,"text":"三、微生物的纯培养与计数","id":"三-微生物的纯培养与计数"},{"level":3,"text":"四、传统发酵技术","id":"四-传统发酵技术"},{"level":3,"text":"五、现代工业发酵","id":"五-现代工业发酵"},{"level":3,"text":"六、发酵工程与基因工程的结合","id":"六-发酵工程与基因工程的结合"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高二生物 — 细胞工程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-2/biology/biotechnology/cell-engineering"},"next":null}